.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-SSSD 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-sssd
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's sssd plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP sssd
\fBplugin\fP sssd
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBsssd\fP plugin collects information from SSSD daemon.
.Pp
The information is read from the SSSD InfoPipe D-Bus service
(\fIorg.freedesktop.sssd.infopipe\fP), so the \fBifp\fP responder must be enabled
in
.Xr sssd.conf 5
and the user running ncollectd must be listed in the
\fBallowed_uids\fP option of the \fB[ifp]\fP section, e.g.:
.Bd -literal
[sssd]
services = nss, pam, ifp

[ifp]
allowed_uids = root
.Ed
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
